&lt;h3 id="1-검은-월요일-검색-200"&gt;1. 검은 월요일 &lt;code&gt;검색 200+&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://imnews.imbc.com/news/2026/econo/article/6867594_36932.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;증시 급락에 정부 긴급 F4 회의‥시장 안정 대책 논의&lt;/a&gt; — MBC 뉴스&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://news.einfomax.co.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=4445881" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
